{"translation-revision-date":"2026-10-06 09:14:37+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=3; plural=(n % 10 == 0 || n % 100 >= 11 && n % 100 <= 19) ? 0 : ((n % 10 == 1 && n % 100 != 11) ? 1 : 2);","lang":"lv"},"Add New":["Pievienot jaunu"],"Some errors occurred while deleting the post types: %s":["Dz\u0113\u0161ot zi\u0146u tipus, rad\u0101s vair\u0101kas k\u013c\u016bdas: %s"],"Failed to create taxonomy.":["Neizdev\u0101s izveidot taksonomiju."],"Where this taxonomy appears: REST API, admin UI, and front-end surfaces.":["Kur \u0161\u012b taksonomija tiek r\u0101d\u012bta: REST API, administr\u0113\u0161anas saskarn\u0113 un vietnes publiskaj\u0101 da\u013c\u0101."],"Core identity, post types, and activation.":["Pamatidentit\u0101te, zi\u0146u tipi un aktiviz\u0113\u0161ana."],"Edit this taxonomy. Expand the Labels section to adjust labels.":["Redi\u0123\u0113jiet \u0161o taksonomiju. Izv\u0113rsiet sada\u013cu Nosaukumi, lai piel\u0101gotu nosaukumus."],"Define a new taxonomy. Fill in the essentials under General; expand Labels to customize.":["Defin\u0113jiet jaunu taksonomiju. Aizpildiet pamatinform\u0101ciju sada\u013c\u0101 Visp\u0101r\u012bgi; izv\u0113rsiet sada\u013cu Nosaukumi, lai tos piel\u0101gotu."],"Add taxonomy":["Pievienot taksonomiju"],"Quick edit taxonomy":["\u0100tri redi\u0123\u0113t taksonomiju"],"Failed to update taxonomy.":["Neizdev\u0101s atjaunin\u0101t taksonomiju."],"\"%s\" taxonomy updated.":["Taksonomija \"%s\" atjaunin\u0101ta."],"Whether terms can be displayed in the Tag Cloud widget.":["Vai terminus var r\u0101d\u012bt birku m\u0101ko\u0146a logr\u012bk\u0101."],"Available in Tag Cloud widget":["Pieejama birku m\u0101ko\u0146a logr\u012bk\u0101"],"Whether terms are selectable in the theme nav menu builder.":["Vai terminus var atlas\u012bt t\u0113mas navig\u0101cijas izv\u0113\u013c\u0146u veidot\u0101j\u0101."],"Available in nav menus":["Pieejama navig\u0101cijas izv\u0113ln\u0113s"],"Whether to display a column for the taxonomy on the associated post type list tables.":["Vai r\u0101d\u012bt taksonomijas kolonnu saist\u012bto zi\u0146u tipu sarakstu tabul\u0101s."],"Show admin column":["R\u0101d\u012bt administr\u0113\u0161anas kolonnu"],"Whether to show the taxonomy in the Quick\/Bulk Edit panel.":["Vai r\u0101d\u012bt taksonomiju \u0101tr\u0101s un lielapjoma redi\u0123\u0113\u0161anas panel\u012b."],"Show in Quick Edit":["R\u0101d\u012bt \u0101traj\u0101 redi\u0123\u0113\u0161an\u0101"],"Whether to show the taxonomy in the admin menu. Has no effect when Show admin UI is off; the value is preserved either way.":["Vai r\u0101d\u012bt taksonomiju administr\u0113\u0161anas izv\u0113ln\u0113. Nav ietekmes, ja iestat\u012bjums R\u0101d\u012bt administr\u0113\u0161anas saskarni ir izsl\u0113gts; v\u0113rt\u012bba tiek saglab\u0101ta abos gad\u012bjumos."],"Show in admin menu":["R\u0101d\u012bt administr\u0113\u0161anas izv\u0113ln\u0113"],"Whether to generate a default admin interface for managing terms.":["Vai \u0123ener\u0113t noklus\u0113juma administr\u0113\u0161anas saskarni terminu p\u0101rvald\u012bbai."],"Show admin UI":["R\u0101d\u012bt administr\u0113\u0161anas saskarni"],"Whether front-end queries (e.g. ?taxonomy=\u2026&term=\u2026) can return terms from this taxonomy.":["Vai vietnes publisk\u0101s da\u013cas vaic\u0101jumi (piem\u0113ram, ?taxonomy=\u2026&term=\u2026) var atgriezt \u0161\u012bs taksonomijas terminus."],"Publicly queryable":["Publiski pieejama vaic\u0101jumiem"],"Required for the block editor. Turn off only for taxonomies that should not be exposed via REST.":["Nepiecie\u0161ams bloku redaktoram. Izsl\u0113dziet tikai taksonomij\u0101m, kur\u0101m nevajadz\u0113tu b\u016bt pieejam\u0101m, izmantojot REST."],"Override the text WordPress shows in admin lists, menus, and forms. Auto-fill replaces every label below with values derived from the current plural and singular names \u2014 including any you have already customized. Clearing removes all overrides so WordPress falls back to its defaults. If you rename the taxonomy after auto-filling, click Auto-fill again to keep them in sync.":["Aizst\u0101jiet tekstu, ko WordPress r\u0101da administr\u0113\u0161anas sarakstos, izv\u0113ln\u0113s un veidlap\u0101s. Autom\u0101tisk\u0101 aizpild\u012b\u0161ana aizst\u0101j visus t\u0101l\u0101k nor\u0101d\u012btos nosaukumus ar v\u0113rt\u012bb\u0101m, kas ieg\u016btas no pa\u0161reiz\u0113jiem nosaukumiem daudzskaitl\u012b un vienskaitl\u012b \u2014 ar\u012b tos, kurus jau esat piel\u0101goju\u0161i. Not\u012br\u012b\u0161ana no\u0146em visus aizst\u0101jumus, lai WordPress izmantotu noklus\u0113juma v\u0113rt\u012bbas. Ja p\u0113c autom\u0101tisk\u0101s aizpild\u012b\u0161anas p\u0101rd\u0113v\u0113jat taksonomiju, v\u0113lreiz noklik\u0161\u0137iniet uz autom\u0101tisk\u0101s aizpild\u012b\u0161anas pogas, lai nosaukumi b\u016btu saska\u0146oti."],"Choose from the most used":["Izv\u0113l\u0113ties no visbie\u017e\u0101k izmantotajiem"],"Shown in the meta box when JavaScript is disabled. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts metadatu lodzi\u0146\u0101, ja JavaScript ir atsp\u0113jots. Netiek izmantots hierarhisk\u0101m taksonomij\u0101m."],"Add or remove items":["Pievienot vai no\u0146emt vienumus"],"Same as Parent item, with a colon at the end.":["Tas pats, kas Vec\u0101kvienums, ar kolu beig\u0101s."],"Shown in the taxonomy meta box. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts taksonomijas metadatu lodzi\u0146\u0101. Netiek izmantots hierarhisk\u0101m taksonomij\u0101m."],"Separate items with commas":["Atdal\u012bt vienumus ar komatiem"],"The popular items text. Not used on hierarchical taxonomies.":["Popul\u0101ro vienumu teksts. Netiek izmantots hierarhisk\u0101m taksonomij\u0101m."],"Popular items":["Popul\u0101rie vienumi"],"Not used on non-hierarchical taxonomies.":["Netiek izmantots nehierarhisk\u0101m taksonomij\u0101m."],"Parent item":["Vec\u0101kvienums"],"Label displayed after a term has been updated.":["Nosaukums, kas tiek r\u0101d\u012bts p\u0113c termina atjaunin\u0101\u0161anas."],"\u2190 Back to Categories":["\u2190 Atpaka\u013c uz kategorij\u0101m"],"Back to items":["Atpaka\u013c uz vienumiem"],"The text displayed when no terms are available in the term meta box and tag cloud.":["Teksts, kas tiek r\u0101d\u012bts, ja terminu metadatu lodzi\u0146\u0101 un birku m\u0101kon\u012b nav pieejamu terminu."],"New item name":["Jaun\u0101 vienuma nosaukums"],"Update item":["Atjaunin\u0101t vienumu"],"A default term name is required.":["Nepiecie\u0161ams noklus\u0113juma termina nosaukums."],"Once saved, updating the name creates a new term \u2014 the previous default term remains in the terms list. To change the term's slug or description, edit it from the terms list.":["P\u0113c saglab\u0101\u0161anas nosaukuma atjaunin\u0101\u0161ana izveido jaunu terminu \u2014 iepriek\u0161\u0113jais noklus\u0113juma termins paliek terminu sarakst\u0101. Lai main\u012btu termina \u012bsv\u0101rdu vai aprakstu, redi\u0123\u0113jiet to terminu sarakst\u0101."],"Default term name":["Noklus\u0113juma termina nosaukums"],"Default term to be used for the taxonomy, similar to how \"Uncategorized\" works for categories.":["Taksonomij\u0101 izmantojamais noklus\u0113juma termins, l\u012bdz\u012bgi k\u0101 kategorij\u0101m darbojas \"Bez kategorijas\"."],"Set a default term":["Iestat\u012bt noklus\u0113juma terminu"],"Whether terms in this taxonomy should be saved in the order they are assigned to an item.":["Vai \u0161\u012bs taksonomijas termini j\u0101saglab\u0101 t\u0101d\u0101 sec\u012bb\u0101, k\u0101d\u0101 tie pie\u0161\u0137irti vienumam."],"Sort terms":["K\u0101rtot terminus"],"View terms":["Skat\u012bt terminus"],"Duplicate taxonomy":["Dubl\u0113t taksonomiju"],"Failed to duplicate taxonomy.":["Neizdev\u0101s dubl\u0113t taksonomiju."],"\"%s\" taxonomy created.":["Taksonomija \"%s\" izveidota."],"taxonomy\u0004%s (Copy)":["%s (kopija)"],"One or more post types with which the taxonomy should be associated.":["Viens vai vair\u0101ki zi\u0146u tipi, kuriem j\u0101piesaista taksonomija."],"Post types":["Zi\u0146u tipi"],"This taxonomy key is already in use.":["\u0160\u012b taksonomijas atsl\u0113ga jau tiek izmantota."],"Lower case letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes only. Maximum length: 32 characters.":["Tikai mazie burti, cipari, pasv\u012btrojumi un defises. Maksim\u0101lais garums: 32 rakstz\u012bmes."],"Changing the key renames the taxonomy \u2014 existing terms may become inaccessible until a migration updates the database.":["Mainot atsl\u0113gu, tiek p\u0101rd\u0113v\u0113ta taksonomija \u2014 eso\u0161ie termini var k\u013c\u016bt nepieejami, l\u012bdz migr\u0101cija atjaunina datub\u0101zi."],"Taxonomy key":["Taksonomijas atsl\u0113ga"],"When on, terms behave like categories with parent-child relationships. When off, terms behave like tags.":["Ja iesp\u0113jots, termini darbojas k\u0101 kategorijas ar vec\u0101kelementu un pak\u0101rtoto elementu attiec\u012bb\u0101m. Ja atsp\u0113jots, termini darbojas k\u0101 birkas."],"Optional summary of the taxonomy. Shown in admin UIs that surface taxonomy details.":["Neoblig\u0101ts taksonomijas kopsavilkums. Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts administr\u0113\u0161anas saskarn\u0113s, kur\u0101s ir pieejama inform\u0101cija par taksonomiju."],"Choose from the most used %s":["Izv\u0113l\u0113ties no visbie\u017e\u0101k izmantotajiem %s"],"Add or remove %s":["Pievienot vai no\u0146emt %s"],"Popular %s":["Popul\u0101rie %s"],"Parent %s":["Vec\u0101kelements %s"],"\u2190 Back to %s":["\u2190 Atpaka\u013c uz %s"],"New %s Name":["Jauns %s nosaukums"],"An error occurred while deleting the taxonomy: %s":["Dz\u0113\u0161ot taksonomiju, rad\u0101s k\u013c\u016bda: %s"],"Failed to delete taxonomies.":["Neizdev\u0101s dz\u0113st taksonomijas."],"Failed to delete taxonomy.":["Neizdev\u0101s dz\u0113st taksonomiju."],"%d taxonomy deleted.":["Dz\u0113sts %d taksonomiju.","Dz\u0113sta %d taksonomija.","Dz\u0113stas %d taksonomijas."],"\"%s\" taxonomy deleted.":["Taksonomija \"%s\" dz\u0113sta."],"Some errors occurred while deactivating the taxonomies: %s":["Deaktiviz\u0113jot taksonomijas, rad\u0101s vair\u0101kas k\u013c\u016bdas: %s"],"An error occurred while deactivating the taxonomy: %s":["Deaktiviz\u0113jot taksonomiju, rad\u0101s k\u013c\u016bda: %s"],"Failed to deactivate taxonomies.":["Neizdev\u0101s deaktiviz\u0113t taksonomijas."],"Failed to deactivate taxonomy.":["Neizdev\u0101s deaktiviz\u0113t taksonomiju."],"%d taxonomy deactivated.":["Deaktiviz\u0113ts %d taksonomiju.","Deaktiviz\u0113ta %d taksonomija.","Deaktiviz\u0113tas %d taksonomijas."],"Taxonomy deactivated.":["Taksonomija deaktiviz\u0113ta."],"Some errors occurred while activating the taxonomies: %s":["Aktiviz\u0113jot taksonomijas, rad\u0101s vair\u0101kas k\u013c\u016bdas: %s"],"An error occurred while activating the taxonomy: %s":["Aktiviz\u0113jot taksonomiju, rad\u0101s k\u013c\u016bda: %s"],"Failed to activate taxonomies.":["Neizdev\u0101s aktiviz\u0113t taksonomijas."],"Failed to activate taxonomy.":["Neizdev\u0101s aktiviz\u0113t taksonomiju."],"%d taxonomy activated.":["Aktiviz\u0113ts %d taksonomiju.","Aktiviz\u0113ta %d taksonomija.","Aktiviz\u0113tas %d taksonomijas."],"Taxonomy activated.":["Taksonomija aktiviz\u0113ta."],"Failed to create post type.":["Neizdev\u0101s izveidot zi\u0146as tipu."],"Labels":["Nosaukumi"],"Core identity, taxonomies, supports, and activation.":["Pamatidentit\u0101te, taksonomijas, atbalst\u012bt\u0101s iesp\u0113jas un aktiviz\u0113\u0161ana."],"Edit this post type. Expand the Labels section to adjust labels.":["Redi\u0123\u0113jiet \u0161o zi\u0146as tipu. Izv\u0113rsiet sada\u013cu Nosaukumi, lai piel\u0101gotu nosaukumus."],"Define a new post type. Fill in the essentials under General; expand Labels to customize.":["Defin\u0113jiet jaunu zi\u0146as tipu. Aizpildiet pamatinform\u0101ciju sada\u013c\u0101 Visp\u0101r\u012bgi; izv\u0113rsiet sada\u013cu Nosaukumi, lai tos piel\u0101gotu."],"Add post type":["Pievienot zi\u0146as tipu"],"Quick edit":["\u0100tr\u0101 redi\u0123\u0113\u0161ana"],"Quick edit post type":["\u0100tri redi\u0123\u0113t zi\u0146as tipu"],"Failed to update post type.":["Neizdev\u0101s atjaunin\u0101t zi\u0146as tipu."],"\"%s\" post type updated.":["Atjaunin\u0101ts zi\u0146as tips \"%s\"."],"Override the text WordPress shows in admin lists, menus, and forms. Auto-fill replaces every label below with values derived from the current plural and singular names \u2014 including any you have already customized. Clearing removes all overrides so WordPress falls back to its defaults. If you rename the post type after auto-filling, click Auto-fill again to keep them in sync.":["Aizst\u0101jiet tekstu, ko WordPress r\u0101da administr\u0113\u0161anas sarakstos, izv\u0113ln\u0113s un veidlap\u0101s. Autom\u0101tisk\u0101 aizpild\u012b\u0161ana aizst\u0101j visus t\u0101l\u0101k nor\u0101d\u012btos nosaukumus ar v\u0113rt\u012bb\u0101m, kas ieg\u016btas no pa\u0161reiz\u0113jiem nosaukumiem daudzskaitl\u012b un vienskaitl\u012b \u2014 ar\u012b tos, kurus jau esat piel\u0101goju\u0161i. Not\u012br\u012b\u0161ana no\u0146em visus aizst\u0101jumus, lai WordPress izmantotu noklus\u0113juma v\u0113rt\u012bbas. Ja p\u0113c autom\u0101tisk\u0101s aizpild\u012b\u0161anas p\u0101rd\u0113v\u0113jat zi\u0146as tipu, v\u0113lreiz noklik\u0161\u0137iniet uz autom\u0101tisk\u0101s aizpild\u012b\u0161anas pogas, lai nosaukumi b\u016btu saska\u0146oti."],"Screen reader text for the admin list table.":["Ekr\u0101nlas\u012bt\u0101ja teksts administr\u0113\u0161anas saraksta tabulai."],"Items list":["Vienumu saraksts"],"Screen reader text for the admin list pagination.":["Ekr\u0101nlas\u012bt\u0101ja teksts administr\u0113\u0161anas saraksta lappu\u0161u p\u0101rsl\u0113g\u0161anai."],"Items list navigation":["Vienumu saraksta navig\u0101cija"],"Screen reader text for the admin list filter controls.":["Ekr\u0101nlas\u012bt\u0101ja teksts administr\u0113\u0161anas saraksta filtr\u0113\u0161anas vad\u012bkl\u0101m."],"Filter items list":["Filtr\u0113t vienumu sarakstu"],"Uploaded to this item":["Aug\u0161upiel\u0101d\u0113ts \u0161aj\u0101 vienum\u0101"],"Shown in the media library uploader.":["Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts multivides bibliot\u0113kas aug\u0161upiel\u0101d\u0113t\u0101j\u0101."],"Insert into item":["Ievietot vienum\u0101"],"Shown above the parent dropdown. Not used on non-hierarchical post types.":["Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts virs vec\u0101kelementa nolai\u017eam\u0101s izv\u0113lnes. Netiek izmantots nehierarhiskiem zi\u0146u tipiem."],"Parent item with colon":["Vec\u0101kvienums ar kolu"],"Title of the Attributes meta box. Not used on non-hierarchical post types.":["Atrib\u016btu metadatu lodzi\u0146a virsraksts. Netiek izmantots nehierarhiskiem zi\u0146u tipiem."],"Used in the navigation menus block when adding a link to the post type archive.":["Tiek izmantots navig\u0101cijas izv\u0113\u013c\u0146u blok\u0101, pievienojot saiti uz zi\u0146as tipa arh\u012bvu."],"Not found in trash":["Atkritn\u0113 nav atrasts"],"Shown in the admin list when no posts match.":["Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts administr\u0113\u0161anas sarakst\u0101, ja nav atbilsto\u0161u zi\u0146u."],"Not found":["Nav atrasts"],"Used as the link label for the post type archive.":["Tiek izmantots k\u0101 zi\u0146as tipa arh\u012bva saites nosaukums."],"View items":["Skat\u012bt vienumus"],"View item":["Skat\u012bt vienumu"],"New item":["Jauns vienums"],"Edit item":["Redi\u0123\u0113t vienumu"],"Shown in the admin menu and on toolbar buttons.":["Tiek r\u0101d\u012bts administr\u0113\u0161anas izv\u0113ln\u0113 un r\u012bkjoslas pog\u0101s."],"Defaults to the plural label.":["P\u0113c noklus\u0113juma izmanto nosaukumu daudzskaitl\u012b."],"Clear labels":["Not\u012br\u012bt nosaukumus"],"Auto-fill labels":["Autom\u0101tiski aiz